    "text": "thejoltnews.com\nwebsite\nTumwater\nMan with active warrant arrested for alleged possession of a stolen car\nBy Darlanne Cruz,\n5 hours agoA 36-year-old man was arrested after authorities found him in an allegedly stolen car parked in the parking lot of a local restaurant in Tumwater. Around 1:49 a.m. on July 12, a roving Tumwater Police Department officer was conducting a business check at Denny’s on Trosper Road SW when he spotted a silver Dodge Charger without license plates in the parking lot. A records check revealed the car had been reported stolen from Cascade Motors several days earlier.",
